# Antigravity Design System & Coding Rules (.antigravityrules)

This file is the single, absolute source of truth for design tokens, styling rules, and coding conventions in this project. All AI agents, models, and developers must follow these rules strictly to ensure visual coherence. **Do not refer to the legacy `design.md` file; use this file instead.**

---

## 1. Stack & Architecture

- **Core**: Astro (pages in `src/pages/`, components in `src/components/`)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 (configured in `src/styles/global.css`)
- **Framework Integration**: React (for interactive components, using `client:load` in Astro)
- **Smooth Scrolling**: Lenis (integrated via `src/components/SmoothScroll.tsx`)
- **Standard UI Elements**: Radix-based custom Shadcn components in `src/components/ui/`

---

## 2. Design Tokens & Mappings

These tokens are configured inside `src/styles/global.css` under Tailwind v4 `@theme`. Always use the corresponding Tailwind utility classes.

### A. Color System

All colors are fully responsive to dark/light modes via CSS variables and semantic classes:

| Token Name        | Value     | Tailwind Class                            | Role / Purpose                                                             |
| :---------------- | :-------- | :---------------------------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Electric Lime** | `#CDF660` | `bg-electric-lime` / `text-electric-lime` | Primary conversion accent, active links in footers, primary CTA background |
| **Brand Dark**    | `#0E1201` | `bg-brand-dark` / `text-brand-dark`       | Hero backgrounds, page containers, dark theme base background              |
| **Deep Black**    | `#000000` | `bg-deep-black` / `text-deep-black`       | Core text, borders, high-contrast overlay elements                         |
| **Sky Blue**      | `#0099FF` | `bg-sky-blue` / `text-sky-blue`           | Secondary interactive accent (rare highlight states)                       |
| **Link Blue**     | `#0000EE` | `bg-link-blue` / `text-link-blue`         | Default web-convention links, inline text links                            |
| **Off-White**     | `#FFFFFF` | `bg-off-white` / `text-off-white`         | Light theme background, card surfaces, high-contrast text                  |
| **Light Gray**    | `#F7F7F7` | `bg-light-gray` / `text-light-gray`       | Subtle background differentiation, light surface variants                  |
| **Pale Cream**    | `#FCFFF5` | `bg-pale-cream` / `text-pale-cream`       | Accent warm neutral for specific sections                                  |
| **Medium Gray**   | `#71726E` | `bg-medium-gray` / `text-medium-gray`     | Secondary text, disabled states, labels of reduced prominence              |
| **Light Neutral** | `#EDEDED` | `bg-light-neutral` / `text-light-neutral` | Standard dividers, borders, separators                                     |

#### Semantic Mode Mapping (Shadcn v4 compatible)

To support dark mode seamlessly, use the following semantic Tailwind tokens:

- **Background**: `bg-background` (Light: `#FFFFFF` | Dark: `#0E1201`)
- **Foreground**: `text-foreground` (Light: `#000000` | Dark: `#FFFFFF`)
- **Card Fill**: `bg-card` (Light: `#FFFFFF` | Dark: `#0E1201`)
- **Borders**: `border-border` (Light: `#EDEDED` | Dark: `rgba(205, 246, 96, 0.2)`)
- **Primary CTA**: `bg-primary text-primary-foreground` (Light: `#0E1201` on `#FFFFFF` | Dark: `#CDF660` on `#000000`)
- **Accent Elements**: `bg-accent text-accent-foreground` (Light/Dark: `#CDF660` on `#000000`)
- **Muted text**: `text-muted-foreground` (Light: `#71726E` | Dark: `#EDEDED`)

