## 3. Core Pre-built Components

Always reuse existing components in `src/components/ui/` rather than re-creating them:

### A. The Button Component (`src/components/ui/button.tsx`)

Usage: `import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"`

Available variants:

1. `primary` (Default): Backed by `#CDF660` (electric-lime). Heavy rounding (`rounded-[40px]`), font size `18px`. Used for core page-level conversions (e.g. "Get in Touch", "Estimate").
2. `secondary`: Transparent background, black border (`dark:border-white`), rounded soft (`rounded-[10px]`). Used for secondary navigations.
3. `tertiary`: Soft gray pill overlay background, fully rounded.
4. `ghost`: Subtle menu hover highlights.
5. `link`: Plain text link styling (`text-link-blue hover:underline`).

Sizes:

- `default`: Height `40px`, padding `0px 24px` (`px-6`)
- `sm`: Height `32px` (`px-4`)
- `lg`: Height `48px` (`px-8`)
- `icon`: Square layout (`size-10`)

---

### B. The Input Component (`src/components/ui/input.tsx`)

Usage: `import { Input } from "@/components/ui/input"`

Variants:

- `variant="light"` (Default): For bright backgrounds. Off-white surface, standard neutral border, placeholder `#71726E`.
- `variant="dark"`: For dark overlays or dark sections. Deep `#0E1201` background, lime border highlight, lime placeholder.

